Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Taal Volcano in the Philippines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,began to erupt on January
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,12, 2020, with a phreatomagmatic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,eruption from its main crater.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.66,0:00:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The eruption sent ashes over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.25,0:00:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Calabarzon, Metro Manila, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,parts of Central Luzon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Philippine Institute of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Volcanology and Seismology
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.53,0:00:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,monitored the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Volcanic activity occurred
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,in 2020.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The eruptions caused suspension
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,of school classes, work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,schedules, and flights in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Taal Volcano is a large
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,caldera filled by Taal Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The volcano is located in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.73,0:00:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the province of Batangas about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,50 kilometers south of Manila.